{"code": "def fizzbuzz(n):\n    result = []\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i % 15 == 0:\n            result.append(\"FizzBuzz\")\n        elif i % 3 == 0:\n            result.append(\"Fizz\")\n        elif i % 5 == 0:\n            result.append(\"Buzz\")\n        else:\n            result.append(str(i))\n    return result", "text": "```python\ndef fizzbuzz(n):\n    result = []\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        if i % 15 == 0:\n            result.append(\"FizzBuzz\")\n        elif i % 3 == 0:\n            result.append(\"Fizz\")\n        elif i % 5 == 0:\n            result.append(\"Buzz\")\n        else:\n            result.append(str(i))\n    return result\n```"}